From: Qianhui Xu <xiaqinghuan@mail.ustc.edu.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] Fastboot: fine bisect probes in CmdBoot (sbstop=11..14)

2026-11-05 y700-elden: sbstop=0（入口即回话）通过、sbstop=1（BootLinux 第一行）崩，
说明崩溃发生在 CmdBoot 入口到 BootLinux 之间。本补丁把这一段再切四刀：

  sbstop=11  SetBootDevImage() 之后
  sbstop=12  ClearUnbootable() 之后（多槽位才走到）
  sbstop=13  LoadImageAndAuth() 之前
  sbstop=14  LoadImageAndAuth() 返回之后

每一刀都只回话（FastbootFail）并 return，不碰镜像、不停 USB。
判据：收到 diag st=Success last=[<tag>] ⇒ 该点之前不崩；无响应 ⇒ 崩在该点之前。

diff --git a/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/FastbootLib/FastbootCmds.c b/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/FastbootLib/FastbootCmds.c
--- a/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/FastbootLib/FastbootCmds.c
+++ b/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/FastbootLib/FastbootCmds.c
@@ -2847,8 +2847,16 @@
   }
 
   SetBootDevImage ();
 
+  // 2026-11-05 y700-elden: 细二分停机点 sbstop=11（after-setbootdevimage）—— 只回话、不动镜像/不停 USB。
+  if (SbParseStopStage ((CONST CHAR8 *)hdr->cmdline) == 11) {
+    AsciiSPrint (Resp, sizeof (Resp), "diag st=Success last=[after-setbootdevimage]");
+    FastbootFail (Resp);
+    return;
+  }
+
+
   Info.Images[0].ImageBuffer = Data;
   /* The actual image size will be updated in LoadImageAndAuth */
   Info.Images[0].ImageSize = Size;
   Info.Images[0].Name = "boot";
@@ -2862,8 +2870,22 @@
       FastbootFail ("CmdBoot: ClearUnbootable failed");
       goto out;
     }
   }
+  // 2026-11-05 y700-elden: 细二分停机点 sbstop=12（after-clearunbootable）—— 只回话、不动镜像/不停 USB。
+  if (SbParseStopStage ((CONST CHAR8 *)hdr->cmdline) == 12) {
+    AsciiSPrint (Resp, sizeof (Resp), "diag st=Success last=[after-clearunbootable]");
+    FastbootFail (Resp);
+    return;
+  }
+
+
+  // 2026-11-05 y700-elden: 细二分停机点 sbstop=13（before-loadimageauth）—— 只回话、不动镜像/不停 USB。
+  if (SbParseStopStage ((CONST CHAR8 *)hdr->cmdline) == 13) {
+    AsciiSPrint (Resp, sizeof (Resp), "diag st=Success last=[before-loadimageauth]");
+    FastbootFail (Resp);
+    return;
+  }
 
   Status = LoadImageAndAuth (&Info);
   if (Status != EFI_SUCCESS) {
     AsciiSPrint (Resp, sizeof (Resp),
@@ -2880,8 +2902,15 @@
   }
   if ((MaxDownLoadSize - (ImageSizeActual - SigActual)) < PageSize) {
     FastbootFail ("BootImage: Size is greater than boot image buffer can hold");
     goto out;
+  }
+
+  // 2026-11-05 y700-elden: 细二分停机点 sbstop=14（after-loadimageauth）—— 只回话、不动镜像/不停 USB。
+  if (SbParseStopStage ((CONST CHAR8 *)hdr->cmdline) == 14) {
+    AsciiSPrint (Resp, sizeof (Resp), "diag st=Success last=[after-loadimageauth]");
+    FastbootFail (Resp);
+    return;
   }
 
   /* Exit keys' detection firstly */
   ExitMenuKeysDetection ();
